# The sobok ghost's face with blood welling from the eye and running from
# her scalp and mouth.
# Gore jump-scare, full screen 320x180. Show for a few frames only, after a quiet
# build-up, with the jumpscare sound; with "reduce flashing" on, show the last
# frame without flicker. Part of the optional gore set (D9).
# GORE SET (optional): hidden when the "gore" option is off; see docs/decisions.md D9.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../jumpscares/jumpscare_gore_bloody_tears.png
@preview ../previews/jumpscare_gore_bloody_tears_x2.png 2
@columns 1

@frame tears





















































































































































































